        "original_id": "5762f976-f9e0-59d8-8901-3faec3259dbc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Dobson, Wilmer Valderrama, María Conchita Alonso, Kathleen Barr, Mary Elizabeth McGlynn, Cusse Mankuma\n- Characters: Starscream, Supreme Kai, Nappa, Cobra Commander, Blob, Leonardo, Pythor, Frederick J. \"Fred\" Dukes\n- Works: Transformers Unicron Trilogy, Dragon Ball Z, The Condor\n- Companies: Marvel Comics\n- Concepts: X-Men, mutant supervillains\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Dobson is best known for voicing Starscream in the Transformers Unicron Trilogy.\n- Michael Dobson voiced Supreme Kai and Nappa in the Ocean dub of Dragon Ball Z.\n- Michael Dobson voiced Cobra Commander, Blob, Leonardo, and Pythor in animated series.\n- The Condor features voice performances by Wilmer Valderrama, María Conchita Alonso, Kathleen Barr, Michael Dobson, Mary Elizabeth McGlynn, and Cusse Mankuma.\n- The Blob, also known as Frederick J. \"Fred\" Dukes, is a fictional supervillain published by Marvel Comics.\n- The Blob is usually depicted as an adversary of the X-Men.\n- The Blob is a mutant originally depicted as an obese circus freak who claims to be immovable when he chooses.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
