        "text": "Page: Michael Dobson (actor). Sentence: He is best known for voicing Starscream in the \"Transformers Unicron Trilogy\" (\"\", \"\", and \"\"), Supreme Kai and Nappa in the Ocean dub of \"Dragon Ball Z\", Cobra Commander in \"\" and \"\", Blob in \"\", Leonardo in \"\", in \"\" and Pythor in \"\", as well as voicing many other characters in animated shows and anime dubs.\nPage: Blob (comics). Sentence: The Blob (Frederick J. \"Fred\" Dukes) is a fictional supervillain appearing in American comic books published by Marvel Comics.\nPage: Blob (comics). Sentence: The character is usually depicted as an adversary of the X-Men.\nPage: Blob (comics). Sentence: A mutant originally depicted as an obese circus freak, the Blob claims to be immovable when he so desires.\nPage: The Condor (film). Sentence: It features the voices of Wilmer Valderrama, María Conchita Alonso, Kathleen Barr, Michael Dobson, Mary Elizabeth McGlynn, and Cusse Mankuma.",
